WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.440
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.780
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.410
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.910
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.500
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.150
At sunset,

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.610
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:10.000
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.880
In a city without light,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.720
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.140
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.430
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.930
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:35.280
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th
grader and TV personality.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.280
My Aoki award-winning Mama.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.950
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.620
The mysterious straight man, Babbit.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.290
Just so you know, Babbit is not a cat.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.290
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:52.960
Kamura Naozumi-kun, a young TV talent who,
like me, hails from Kamura Academy.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.380
It's a photo of Sana-chan
and Naozumi-kun on a date!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.640
Sana-chan? You vixen!

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.970
Yow! Yow! I knew they would be coming,
but these arrows still sting.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.640
Don't stare at me from a distance, okay?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:08.980
"Clarification Conference"

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.310
Okay, okay, quiet down, and I will explain.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:07.310
And please, listen super-calmly.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.980
Would you out out that "super" business!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:13.320
You know what? Behind Naozumi-kun and me,
there was a bunch of production staff.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.320
Naozumi-kun and I were waiting on standby.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.660
But you two are holding
hands tightly, aren't you?

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.660
Right, look closely.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.990
You see? It's a handheld game.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:27.330
In short, while we were waiting on standby,
I borrowed Naozumi-kun's handheld game.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.330
All right, go, gotcha!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.000
It gets harder after this.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Oh, how do I do this part?

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.340
Oh, this part, you see...

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.960
And at this point, somebody
somewhere snuck a picture of us.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.510
It really is just an innocent,
insignificant picture, ma'am.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.630
Okay, any questions?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.640
--What's most charming about Naozumi-kun?
--Has he given you any presents?

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.970
--How long have you been going out?
--Which one of you asked the other out?

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.310
Did you even listen to what I said?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.270
The masses love this kind of material.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.520
Be quiet! Everybody shut up!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.020
So, have you kissed yet?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.070
"This clarification conference is over"

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.200
"The Snake Stomps In
With His Shoes Still On"

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.860
Look at this picture of love-love.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.030
--What do you mean, "love-love," you jerk!?
--This late-night date between Kamura
Naozumi-kun and Kurata Sana-chan...

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.700
--Don't swallow what that picture is telling you!
--This late-night date between Kamura
Naozumi-kun and Kurata Sana-chan...

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.040
It's okay, let them say
whatever they want to.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.210
It's just a bogus photo to begin with-
Ah, damn it! Why, you...

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.540
-and there's nothing to it- What!? Yikes!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.710
Is that the handheld game that
Sana-chan borrowed from Naozumi-kun?

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.880
Of course there isn't! I wouldn't
allow there to be anything more to it!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.210
Well then, just leave it alone- Gah! What?
All of a sudden UFOs are shooting at me!?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.720
Why should that kid and Sana-chan
have to be in love-love, anyhow?

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.060
No, Sana-chan and I are just good friends.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.730
--Do you think those two
are really going out?
--When we're in this line of work,

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.060
--I've heard that rumor before, too.
--rumors like this tend
to get very exaggerated.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.150
During the uproar over that essay,
Naozumi-kun defended Sana-chan, didn't he?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.360
They're together, all right.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.190
What? Did you just say, "Heh"?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.530
What a shifty fellow! Show your face!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.030
You can go now...

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.030
"Ah, that was scary"

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.030
You big chicken!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.000
"The Yellow Letter Co."

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.120
A photo of Kurata Sana kissing?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.040
What?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.000
Here it is.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.370
Oh, that's from that time before!
Why do you have a picture of it?

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.040
Kurata is not going out with Kamura.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.340
She is going out with Hayama Akito,
who is in this picture with her, Editor.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.220
As you can see, they are even kissing.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.390
Who is he?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.760
One of Kurata's classmates.
I have others, too.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:12.230
--Ah! Is that...
--This is the boy who took her away from
home during Kurata Misako's essay scandal.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.560
--Huh? This one, too?
--Wherever Kurata is,
this Hayama Akito is with her.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.690
Even this?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.150
This one is from just recently.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.030
I see... But unfortunately,
I can't use these, Kurosaki-kun.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.570
W- why not!? With Kurama and Kamura causing
a big stir among the public right now,

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.070
this will be a scoop!

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.870
I can sort of make out
the face on this Hayama boy,

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.660
but none of them clearly shows Kurata Sana.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.670
That's not true!
That is genuinely Kurata Sana!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.000
Maybe so, but it's not conclusive.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.840
Not without something definitive.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.470
Too bad, huh, Pops?

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.680
Damn it. I'll pass this chance up,

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.010
but I am definitely going to
get my scoop, Kurata Sana.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.350
Gah! This is one positively
nasty fellow who has appeared!

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.020
We're going to plow right
through the press corps. Ready?

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.360
Okay!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.690
Here we go, Sana-yan!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.690
Here it comes, Rei-yan!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.360
Safe driving?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.030
Rei-kun, I'm going to walk.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.200
Sana-chan!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.370
♪ Move it, move it,
Sana-chan coming through! ♪

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.370
♪ How can I be an entertainer, ♪

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.200
♪ and be afraid of
entertainment reporters? ♪

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.370
--Sana-chan, what company are
you keeping with Naozumi-kun?
--♪ Here they come, ambush reporters. ♪

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.370
--Do you have any response...
--♪ Run too much, and you're
going to fall down. ♪

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.380
♪ Naozumi-kun is just a friend from work. ♪

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.540
♪ That photo is bogus! ♪

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.710
♪ Out of the way! Watch out!
I got caught on one of you! ♪

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.710
--Mama bought these mail order.
--Aw, she's gone.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.390
That was pretty easy, avoiding those
entertainment reporters like that.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.060
Sana-chan, hello.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.310
It's "nice to meet you,"
isn't it? Sorry about that.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.980
I watch you all the time,
and all, Sana-chan.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.650
Here's who I am. It's a pleasure.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.980
Free entertainment reporter?

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.990
Hey! It's against the rules for you
to be chasing me inside the TV station!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.650
I'm not going to answer
a single question of yours!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.320
No, no, please don't lump me
in with those guys outside.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.160
I'm not at all interested in that
rumor about you and Naozumi-kun.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.660
That's a bunch of nonsense, right?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.670
Could I have just a
little bit of your time?

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.670
There's a different air about
him now than there was before...

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.840
That was scary!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.340
Want some coffee, Kurosaki-san?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.340
Oh, thanks.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.350
The truth is, I've been a fan
ever since your debut, Sana-chan.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.680
I've been behind you the whole time.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.020
Thank you very much.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.350
My children are fans, too, Sana-chan.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:19.020
Yeah? Kurosaki-san, you have children?

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.520
Yeah, two of them.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.360
Sana-chan, being on "Child's Toy",
you must eat Zenjiro-san right up, huh?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.360
No way! If I ate Zenjiro-san,
I'm sure he would be yucky!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.030
Is that the way you are
by nature, Sana-chan?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.330
Well, I haven't really thought about it.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.990
What are you like usually, Sana-chan?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.160
Oh, I'm not that much different.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.330
A little precocious,
like you are on TV, then.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.000
You must be fairly ahead
of the others in school, too.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.500
Is there a boy that you hang around with?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.010
There is, isn't there?
If it isn't Kamura-kun, then who?

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.340
Hayama-kun?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.840
Uh... um...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.510
Tell me, Sana-chan.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.560
No, I couldn't...

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.350
How 'bout it, Sane-yan?
Today's taping was easy, huh?

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.020
No, that was rough.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.360
Huh? Hold on a second!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:05.360
You shouldn't have to think
about it that hard, right?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.690
You just have to give me a simple answer.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.690
Well...

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.700
This guy is a snake.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.530
Ah, Sana-chan, Sana-chan!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.530
What's wrong with you? The shoot is
about to start! Let's go, let's go!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.370
The only thing you don't have enough of...

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.700
Sana-chan, see you later.
Work with me more next time, okay?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.710
--That would be the cordial thing to do.
--...is constipation medicine, aloha owe...

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.340
"Snake reporter"

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.040
Babbit hates snakes!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.380
Snakes are delicious.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.550
That guy is the woist!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.380
He's an unbelievable snake reportuh.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.630
If he sets his eye on you,
you've got trouble!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.300
Sana-chan, what did he ask you?

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.300
Nothing, much.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.640
Really?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.810
I can put up with just about anything,

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.230
but that guy's pestering
is too much for me!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.980
That was back when I had that crush
on Yuri-chan, from the Zuke-Zuke Gals.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.650
Like that time I blew off woik and
hung out in front of her house,

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.980
or aftuh she stopped liking me,

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.650
and I followed her awl
around Osaka on my bicycle...

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.320
He took pitchus of awl of it!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.650
Zenjiro-chan, you're awful.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.990
Sane-yan, you keep quiet!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.990
Thanks, but really,
there's nothing going on.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:00.620
"Snake reporter"

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.330
Ah, thank goodness the snake is gone.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.000
I fried him up, and now I'm eating him.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.660
You're kidding!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.330
Sana-chan! You're safe!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.000
Rei-kun, what happened? You look cool.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.840
Sana-chan, I'm surprised
you were able to fight your way

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.840
through that mountain of reporters!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.340
They caught me, and
peppered me with questions.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.340
What answer did you give them?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.680
That "I am not seeing
Kamura Naozumi", of course.

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:15.760
You liked that?
You liked that?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.310
"I can tell jokes, too"

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.180
When I'm happy, my sunglasses fall down.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.310
Happy-go-lucky, aren't you?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.350
Yo, Piyoko! Long time no see!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.650
It's morning, grab the paper,
the newspaper...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.660
Woah! I'm late because I watched those
morning anime re-runs! Rei-kun, drive me!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.830
What's the matter, Sana-chan?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.000
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.130
Something funny's going on...

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:46.960
Good morning!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.000
Sleep in again?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.500
I just got a little careless.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.510
I got up early enough today,
which is rare for me,

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.300
but the anime on this
morning was so amusing,

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.510
and before I realized it, it was 8:30!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.020
Uh-oh, I don't know
what to do about this...

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.980
Who is that guy?

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.350
Did we just get our picture taken?

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.650
Sorry, he's just this reporter that I know.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.360
Then, are we going to be in a magazine?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.320
No, it's all right,
I won't let him do that.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.320
--We don't mind!
--Let him!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.690
Oh, is that right?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.700
Hey there, Aya-chan and everyone!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.160
Good morning, Tsuyoshi-kun and company!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.450
Let's stop centering your
greetings on just the two of you.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.750
Say, Sana-chan, do I reek of natto beans?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.370
What's wrong, Hayama? In a bad mood?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:26.000
Not really.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.040
You know what? I had three
bowls of natto this morning!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:28.670
You did?

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.880
Hayama, are you in a bad
mood about something?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.880
Not really.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.140
Ha! You broke it!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.300
Who's that?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.640
Pay no attention, pay no...

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:46.310
There is, isn't there? If it isn't
Kamura-kun, then who? Hayama-kun?

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.400
Don't tell me he's after a
two-shot of me and Hayama...

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:50.980
Eh? A spare!?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:51.820
Move it!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.650
I'm going on ahead!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.650
Sana-chan is acting weird.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.650
That's not so unusual, though.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.660
Akito-kun, what have you
done to Sana-chan this time?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:09:59.660
Nothing.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.320
Damn.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.450
Nyah! Take that!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.330
Huh? What? What are you thinking?

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.290
Ah, he's thinking up something bad!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.290
"Ah, that was scary"

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.000
If you're scared,
you should stop butting in.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.290
But that's my job.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.010
All right, he's finally gone, huh?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:16.840
Hey.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.430
Don't come close to me!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.680
Sorry, but we're being targeted.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.350
Akito-kun, what did you do to Sana-chan?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.010
Nothing.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:27.180
Has that reporter set his eye
on me and Hayama, of all people?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.350
While all the rest of the world
is in a tizzy over that picture of me
and Naozumi-kun? I can't let my guard down!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.230
"And so..."

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.310
He's got a fever now.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:40.610
He appears to be gone now.
He's not that big a snake at all, is he?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.280
Let's go to work, Rei-kun!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.950
Sana-chan is being incredibly weird.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.290
That's not so unusual, though.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.620
--But Akito-kun is down in the dumps.
--What's going on with you? I'll peck you.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.290
That is unusual, huh?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.290
This week's dark and gloomy Akito-kun.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.130
Hey, it's so dark, it's not turning out.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:53.960
Leave me alone.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.750
That's odd...

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.800
"An odd turn of events"

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.130
Aah! Sana-fin! Aah! Sana-fin!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.630
Sagami-san, there's a phone call for you.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.970
Huh? For me?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:04.600
Uh-huh... Yes, okay... Yes...

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.980
Akito, they've already hung up,
but someone called for you.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.150
They hung up, though.
But it was for you.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.150
Odd, isn't it?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.650
Huh? Where's Rei-kun?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.980
Ah, Sana-chan...

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.650
The office just got a message
for you from Sagami-san.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.990
Huh? From Rei-kun?
What's this about?

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.660
What a bizarre phone call!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.160
No, I don't want to buy a membership
to some scrub brush club!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.660
Huh? Are they done shooting?

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.330
For a while now.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.330
Why would Rei-kun call me
all the way out here?

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.000
Kurata...

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.500
Huh? He looks just like Hayama!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.340
It is Hayama.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.000
What a coincidence!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.340
It's no coincidence.
Sunglasses-sewn called me here.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.550
Then it is a coincidence!
Rei-kun called me out here, too!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.220
It's not a coincidence!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.010
The snake!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.020
What are you doing!?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.520
Hayama, don't show your face!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.390
What's going on?

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.690
Odd... isn't it?

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.540
Are you Kurosaki-san?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.830
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.880
You're on your way to sell some scoop
photos to a picture tabloid, right?

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.540
Such an underhanded
thing you're doing, isn't it?

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.210
Could I have a little of your time?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.220
My sensei says she would
like to talk with you.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.550
Oh, excuse the late introduction. I am-

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.890
Sagami Rei, right? Kurata's manager.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.890
Oh, so you do know me.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.600
Yes, and I know that you
are seeing that actress.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.850
H- how do you know that!?

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.190
I was just seeing if you would admit to it.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.690
I- in any case, the
Sensei is asking for you.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.690
Get it together!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:45.490
Kurosaki-san, what you are doing
may not be against any laws,

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.530
but it is not to your credit.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.410
It is so to my credit, Sensei.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.540
Everyone wants to know the private
affairs of Kurata Sana, idol to a nation.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.540
By offering that to them,
I am a credit to my occupation.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.550
Is that true, even when someone gets hurt?

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:04.550
Huh? Who gets hurt? After all,
those two are seeing each other.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.550
Don't tell me you weren't
aware of that, right?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:12.220
Hayama-kun is not a performer. His
situation is not the same as Kamura-kun's.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.060
I'm sorry, but that doesn't matter.
Not as long as Kurata Sana is a performer.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.570
Let me make my request clear.
Do not publish pictures of Hayama-kun.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.400
I must decline. This is
my profession, after all.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.240
A- are you trying to threaten me!?

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:33.160
Not especially. My hand was just itchy.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.830
So, which do you prefer, black
coffee or morning tomato juice?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.170
What are you talking about?
Morning tomato juice.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.500
Which kind of stomach medicine
do you take, pills or granules?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.510
Granules. Why are you asking?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.470
Ho... You're...

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:48.840
What!?

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.510
Kurosaki-san, would you show me the photo?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.510
What?

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:55.350
This isn't some cheap trick to take
the photo away and tear it up.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.600
You can print as many more
copies of it as you want, right?

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.690
This picture...

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.610
Can I have it?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.530
What?

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.110
Sana looks good in this.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.870
If I were one of Sana's true fans,
I would want to see her face like this.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.530
You...

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.950
...have the skills to do
good work, you know.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.870
You don't have to stoop
to this rotten sort of work.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.880
Hmph, you're trying to sidestep the
matter, but that won't work on me.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.210
Sorry, but I've decided I'm going
to be a little more thorough.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.550
I'm the type who shoots back
when someone comes at me.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.220
Waugh! Something's passing over me!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.260
"The reporter leaves"

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.470
Don't open your eyes.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.180
Sensei...

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.140
Mama...

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.140
I got it.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.140
Sensei!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:39.310
What do we do? Hayama is
going to be dragged into this.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.150
Sana, get engaged to Hayama-kun!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.530
Yes, then we can beat him
to the announcement.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.320
--I will tell Papa Hayama myself.
--Sensei, you're going too far!
That's crazy!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.240
--Hello, this is Kurata Misako.
--Mama! Mama! Hold on! Hold on! Stop! Stop!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.570
This is Hayama Fuyuki.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.030
Hayama Natsumi-san?

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.040
I'm nobody you need to be afraid of.
I'm a magazine reporter.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:02.210
I wanted to ask you a few
things about your brother.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:05.170
Your mother died soon after giving
birth to your brother, right?

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.840
What was it like for your brother,
growing up without a mother?

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.840
Did you know that your brother and
Kurata Sana were going out together?

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.390
Sana-chan also appears to have had some
circumstances surrounding her birth.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.680
I'd like to write an article about the
things they have in common in that area.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.940
Cooperate with me, sister.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:27.570
I'll be back tomorrow, Natsumi-chan.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.200
Maybe I'll go to your school tomorrow.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.830
Sana-chan, I just feel so creeped out.
I'm afraid to go outside.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.250
I'm sorry about this,
Natsumi-san. It's all right.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.500
That tears it!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.500
Yahoo!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.840
How can I be a 6th grade TV personality
if I'm afraid of some snake reporter!?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.260
Yahoo!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.340
That's her!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:58.520
Sensei, bad news! Sana-chan has gone
off to that snake's place alone!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.190
W- what should we do!? If she
gets bitten by that snake...

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.940
Don't panic, Sagami.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.190
According to the personality assessment
notebook, he may seem like a snake,

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.860
but he's really a human.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.820
Yeah, well, that may be true...

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.860
It's all right.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.370
"The snake's nest"

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.530
She's here!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:20.200
Minamino Ward, Unatsuki Block,
Henogonomu Building, Unatsuki #8005...

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.540
Right here!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.370
Are you in there, you snake!?
I'm calling you out! I'm calling you out!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.210
Ow!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.210
Hayama...

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:27.880
Stop.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.210
Out of the way, Hayama!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.050
What are you going to do?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.680
Isn't that obvious? I'm going to get him
to stop having anything to do with us!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.470
Now?

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.050
That's obvious, isn't it!?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.890
Ah, I hadn't thought about that.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:44.480
I heard what happened from Natsumi.
We'll be fine. That picture is no big deal.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.150
Let him do what he wants. Even if it
causes a stir, it will only be for a while.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.480
Hayama...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.820
It disgusts me, but just think of it as
being bitten by a snake, and get past it.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.990
Still...

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.830
I just can't do that!
It's wrong, any way I think about it!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.830
Why should we have to be put
through that unpleasantness!?

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.160
Hey, snake man!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.330
--Stop!
--Yes?

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.170
Who's there?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.170
Who is it?

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.170
Huh? You're not snakes...

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.050
"Kurosaki Toshizo Shoko Tatsuya"

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.340
Oh, come to think of it,
he did say he had children.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.840
Huh? Sana-chan?

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.510
Sana-chan?

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.180
Sana-chan! You're Kurata Sana-chan, right?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.180
Wow, you're right! Just like on TV!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.510
Yes, I'm Sana!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.350
Suddenly, you're wearing your work smile?

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.850
Why? Why is the real Sana-chan here?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.850
Well, there are a number
of important reasons...

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.560
Hey, stop poking me where you shouldn't be.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.860
Um, is your father home?

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:30.860
No, he's working.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.480
You need something from Dad?

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.820
Actually, we do.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.150
Smells like something's burning.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.160
Oh, no! Ah, the soup has boiled over!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.490
Tatsuya, get a dishrag!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.830
You dummy! Those are your underpants!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.330
Ah! Turn off the gas! That's dangerous!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.620
Here Hayama, wipe that up with the dishrag!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.460
"Things go in an unexpected direction"

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.830
Time to panic.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.500
These used to be hamburgers, right?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.840
The soup is ruined, too.
This is all our fault.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.500
"Our"?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.840
That's okay, that's okay.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.170
Sister, what about supper?

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:57.510
You kids are cooking dinner by
yourselves? What's your mom doing?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.850
Our mom...

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.010
She died.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.760
"Just like Hayama's family"

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:04.850
What kind of dishrag is this?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.180
Ah! That's my dinosaur!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.350
Dinosaur?

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.690
That's the tail from the dinosaur costume

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.360
Tatsuya is going to wear
in the school arts fair tomorrow.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.530
I'm the one who thought it was
a dishrag, and handed it to him.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.860
And this potholder...?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.200
That's the head.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.200
You dummy! You dummy!
That's my stegosaurus!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.540
--Stegosaurus? Hey!
--My sister worked really hard making
it for me! What did you do that for?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.210
Don't sell the stegosaurus short.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:30.380
Listen up. A stegosaurus looks like this.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.790
Don't kid around when it comes
to the shape of his dorsal plates.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:35.800
He's got four spikes on his tail,
see? Don't belittle that part.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.470
Do you have any newspaper and coat hangers?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.760
Oh, yes we do!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.300
--So Hayama is a dinosaur freak, huh?
--Do you have any cardboard you don't need?

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.470
--I didn't know that.
--Some glue and scissors, too.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.810
Okay then, Sana-chan will
work hard on cooking, too!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.140
Huh? You will, Sana-chan?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.480
I've been on cooking shows before!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.810
My, there aren't very many
ingredients in here, huh?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.150
Sorry.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.320
That's okay, that's okay!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:56.490
With this much, we can make
Sana-chan style "Ofu-rench Toast"!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:59.150
Set up the Nopia, and...

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.160
♪ Crumble, crumble,
break the kurumafu bread ♪

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.820
♪ into little pieces-
itafu bread is also okay. ♪

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.830
♪ Crack some eggs, too- 1, 2, 3, ♪

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.660
♪ be sure to add plenty, okay? ♪

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.330
♪ Pour in lots of soy sauce, ♪

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.330
♪ then add some chopped-up bacon. ♪

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.170
♪ Salt and pepper- ♪

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.670
♪ -and if you like it spicy,
sesame chili oil is okay, too! ♪

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.500
Okay, Shoko-chan, stir it up real good!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.510
In the meantime, I'll work on a salad.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.510
Let it sit for a little bit.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.510
--We have to let the eggs
soak in nice and good.
--Hey, Tatsuya...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:21.840
Maybe we could even add sesame oil.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.510
Shoko-chan, Tak-kun, I'm back!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.510
Hey, snake!

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.850
Welcome home!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.970
Oh, it's the snake!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.520
What are you doing here!?

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.150
"Sudden confrontation!"

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.770
What do you think you're doing?

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.650
Were you trying to cajole the children
into appealing for my sympathy?

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.490
You are so crooked! All you ever look
into is the seedy side of people,

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.780
so you've lost the ability to look
at things for what they really are!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.160
Hmph, that's the line of work I'm in.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.030
Oh, very nice! Kurosaki-san,

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.830
even though your business might be to poke
your nose into other people's dirty feet...

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.830
What are you talking about?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:52.790
...we saw the family you
are making sure to protect.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.840
I've got a weakness for nice families.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.590
Their dad might be a snake,
but the children are growing up proper.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:58.840
We'll let this incident pass,

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.130
and regard ourselves as having been bitten
by a passing cobra, like Hayama said.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.510
I never said that.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.970
But will you at least let me say this much?

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:08.470
Because of you, there are people who
have had their hearts deeply hurt!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.850
Like there's a cactus inside
them, pricking at them!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:14.190
As long as you know that, you go ahead
and keep your own warm household.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.190
Sana-chan! Let's finish cooking!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.650
Akito, hurry and make me a stegosaurus!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:20.530
Okay, let's do it.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.820
--Yeah, right. Come on, Dad, help us out!
--What?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.700
♪ Put some oil in a frying pan, ♪

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.490
♪ then pour the egg-soaked... ♪

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.040
♪ ...ofu bread mixture in the pan, under
high heat, and cook until it's crunchy. ♪

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.870
--The salad is done!
--♪ It's almost done! ♪

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.460
Huh? What's this?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.790
Dad, you're good at this.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.630
Hey, Pop, make the underside of the tail
slightly more pale. Don't disrespect it.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.960
It's a picture of Sana-chan!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:40.460
Ah, Shoko-chan! Don't touch that...

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.470
Oh, show me, show me!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.800
No, Tak-kun, you can't...

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.140
Watch what you're doing, Pop!
It'll be uneven.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:47.140
Ah! Akito is in it, too!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.970
Dad, are you a fan of Sana-chan, too?

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.480
--Hey, can we have this?
--I want it!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.140
No, you can't have that one...

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.810
Pop, get painting!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.810
You like it that much? He'll give it to
you, he'll give it to you. Right, Dad?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.480
Yay! Sana-chan said it was okay!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.480
Well...

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.780
Come on, Pop, give it to them!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.990
All right, given the circumstances,
maybe I'll even sign it.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.830
Look, Dad! Sana-chan's autograph!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.490
Sana-chan, thank you!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.160
It was nothing. Your dad sure
takes nice pictures, huh?

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.500
Dad, thank you! Today
has been an amazing day!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.170
I'm going to record this
in my picture journal!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.840
Pop, are you going to do this!?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:25.180
"We ate the Ofu-rench toast!"

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.510
Sana-chan's "Ofu-rench
toast" is pretty good.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.510
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:25.340
Want some fried snake?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.510
Kurata Sana...

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.680
I'm canceling it.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:39.860
However, I will say this.
I don't care who gets hurt.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.530
There are hordes of folks who are
thrilled by this material, after all.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.360
I'm not going to change
the way I work after this, either.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.860
You don't say, you don't say.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:50.200
You never know when
I'll come after you again.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.200
Okay, you're on!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:53.870
You snaky old man!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.870
Snaky old man, about the stegosaurus...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.210
Don't touch it all night
long. It's not dry yet.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.010
Did Sana-chan go home?

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:04.670
Yeah.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:08.010
Wasn't that incredible, Dad?
We became friends with Sana-chan!

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:10.850
Ah, there's more. Oh,
these aren't of Sana-chan.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.850
Yeah, I just took those
outside the train station.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:16.350
There was a bad man there,
who was arrested for acting wild.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.020
Hold on, that's Father Oki!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.190
Huh? You mean Tsuyoshi-kun's father?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:24.360
Ah, it's gotten so late.
Father Hayama must be worried.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:26.570
Nah, my old man is pretty carefree.

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:28.860
They're late, aren't they?

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:30.030
Those two youngsters...

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:31.370
What are we going to do, Sensei!?

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:34.290
You made that phone call, and now he's
taking the engagement talk seriously!

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:36.200
According to the personality
assessment notebook,

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:39.540
he looks like a regular father,
but on the inside, he's a pumpkin.

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.920
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.930
Whoa! This is a shock, a
peach tree, a fillet of pike!

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:17.600
Tsuyoshi-kun's dad, Father Oki,
has been arrested? How did that happen?

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:20.600
Aah, aah, Tsuyoshi-kun, Tsuyoshi-kun,
don't let it get you down!

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:23.270
We will always stand by you, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:24:23.270 --> 00:24:27.270
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode
32, the "Moved by Love and Tears" saga,

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:31.610
Dad, You've Been Arrested

00:24:31.610 --> 00:24:34.610
Dad! Mom! Sister! Be strong!
